WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:05.400
HIPAA training. Module 4. Patients' rights over their information.

2
00:00:06.800 --> 00:00:13.200
The information in a patient's record is about them, so the Privacy Rule gives patients rights over it.

3
00:00:14.400 --> 00:00:17.233
Access: see and copy their records.

4
00:00:17.567 --> 00:00:20.200
Amendment: ask for a correction.

5
00:00:20.567 --> 00:00:23.800
Accounting: a list of certain disclosures.

6
00:00:24.167 --> 00:00:27.433
Restriction: ask to limit sharing.

7
00:00:27.767 --> 00:00:31.967
Confidential communications: a different method or place.

8
00:00:32.300 --> 00:00:35.833
Complaint: to the clinic or to HHS.

9
00:00:37.100 --> 00:00:42.000
The clinic generally answers an access request within 30 days.

10
00:00:42.333 --> 00:00:45.967
It acts on a correction request within 60 days.

11
00:00:46.300 --> 00:00:50.100
An accounting covers the six years before the request.

12
00:00:51.300 --> 00:00:52.933
Listen and thank them.

13
00:00:53.300 --> 00:00:55.633
Take down only the request.

14
00:00:55.967 --> 00:00:58.900
Do not send or change records yourself.

15
00:00:59.267 --> 00:01:02.300
Pass it on the client's way, the same day.

16
00:01:02.633 --> 00:01:04.867
Tell them what happens next.

17
00:01:06.100 --> 00:01:06.667
Stop.

18
00:01:07.067 --> 00:01:08.067
Do not share.

19
00:01:08.467 --> 00:01:09.600
Ask your lead.

20
00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:11.733
Now read the module.
